{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Fit Sesh 是一款專注於步行、跑步、遠足及單車的 GPS 運動追蹤工具，適合想清楚掌握路線與即時數據的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-80.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>運動路線與即時數據</h2>\n<p>Fit Sesh 會在地圖上顯示步行、跑步、遠足或單車路線，同時記錄距離、時間、配速、速度、爬升及估算活動卡路里，並可自訂顯示指標。每次運動後可查看已儲存路線、摘要與教練提示，亦可製作附路線地圖的 PDF 報告。應用另提供活動偵測、智能摘要、自然語言搜尋、目標與提醒，權限只按你選用的功能提出。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-504-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-505-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-506-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-507-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-508-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-509-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Fit Sesh: GPS Workout Tracker</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/fit-sesh-gps-workout-tracker/id6777316720?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:04.897441+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":310,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T05:06:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:14:17.974578+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:48.798991+00:00","content_hash":"6648687c5275f6a5b87e0f9b65e7c99a467d5e2be195d6aa147edc1b7839b7a3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}